  <div slot="title">The Alliance (Fort Division)</div>
  <div class="disambiguation">
  <p><em>The Alliance is the name of the official hero organisation of the Philippines. This article only covers the Fort division.<br/>
  For other city divisions, see <a href="#" class="neverVisited">The Alliance (disambiguation)</a>.</em></p>
  </div>

  <p>The Alliance (Fort Division) is the largest hero team in the Fort. As a division of the national Alliance,
  they fall under the direction of <a href="/parahumans/bopa">BOPA</a>.</p>

  <h2>Known Members</h2>
  <h3>Flawless</h3>
  <p>Flawless is the leader of the Alliance (Fort Division). His body is made entirely of a type of sky-blue crystal
  of a type previously unknown to science. This makes Flawless impervious to explosive force, gunshots, and other
  physical attacks.
  <p>Flawless also has enhanced strength, able to shatter concrete and lift cars.</p>
  <h3>Habi</h3>
  <p>Habi is a tinker, specialising in fabrics. Her costume is packed with various powerful fabric technology,
  such as gecko-grip fingertips, kinetic impact points, and static electricity blasts.</p>
  <h3>Warmup</h3>
  <p>Powers include super strength and super speed, triggered by charging up kinetic energy.</p>
  <h3>Crucible</h3>
  <p>Crucible was a trade between the Philippines Alliance and the United States' Protectorate. He is able to
  create a spherical forcefield around himself or others.</p>
</ParahumanWikiLayout>